    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dabita gheeda sibata ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasin heeda wagiida sisna lagheanga oomng'i, geawundaanyi geegala geatin diktam nea baraknataanyi geegala geatin diktam, nea geawundaanyi gal humng'eeda geegala geatin damanamughuush. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasin basooda beasta, gidang'eada mareedi ea gagal mareeta niirja geegala geatin damanamughuush, aba neaweesiindaanyi, geawundaanyi gal humng'eeda geegala geatin muut, nea ghealooda siiteena gaba geatin diktam ea damanamughuush neaweesiinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea uutaanyi gwanda haleanjeeda uurji heeyda, neaweesa meatkwajeega sean, aba geatin diktam ea damanamughuush, nea ghadeatka gweata ghealoon iyeenya, ak geegwardeayda heeda ghayi sigwardeaysa basooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goobiida iheenga heew damaniyeenya, samwageenyaawa gang'ula wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa, ak samwagu gang'ula heeda biyeara, aba samwagu gang'ula wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara, ak samwageeda huuydean gang'ula heeda ghayeawa; ak basooda geayiin iheenga nyaawa ak nea badahuuka nyaawa heeda funyaat gafursa jih. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea baraknataanyi gwadeena baneakta siida, nea jeadaanyi mareataanyi geesinda dea gikoombe, gawuurji deakghweeda miyaas, nea jeadaanyi ghoamu goobiida liitaji sagalamnyooji samwagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasin haragweak damanamughuush, ng'ata ghwayiin muut meatkweeda geatinda dugwa aba muut ghwayiin meatkweeda geatinda ghaadaam, was gea jea eehuuniida, jea eehuuna lukghumajeega, nea basooda ea dea jea goohuuniida ashoohoodiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwasin haleanjeeda jea gamiineadayeewa gheaboonyanga was mooneeda nyaawa ea damanamughuush gawuurji gida ghayi sirugu, ak ghwayiin jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA, hean ghwayiin muut meatkweeda geatinda dugwa, ak muut ghwayiin meatkweeda geatinda ghaadaam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasin measaji damanamughuush, ak ghwayiin jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA, ghwayiin muut meatkweeda geatinda dugwa, aba muut huuydean ghwayiin meatkweeda geatinda ghaadaam. Ng'ata gwasin bwakuraji bughala bea lagheanga siguura dahaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin doodooda ashoohoodiga, ak gwasin eara doodooda haw, ak ghwajap gidaghuudajeega nyaawa aba lagheanga oomng'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea badooda ghwayiin meatkweeda geatinda dugwa bea heeda ghayeawa, goofuursa geaw wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasin Huramu dahuundiga, ea mageemboojiga ea bakurajeega. Hean ghwahit Huramu gadiyeeda ghayi sissa sugoocheanda was Sulemani bea gheeda ASEETA; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea daranaji iyeenya, ea bakurajeega, ea shiip iyeenya mida iheenga daranajeega; ea gheareedan iyeenya jea eedukuteawa bwakuraji iyeenya bea shiipka mida iheenga daranajeega; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea geedi siguura goomamanga was bughalaji ang'wan bea nghear iyeenya, ea ghealoon iyeenya bea geediga siguura goomamanga aba gilinyoo ea nghearjeanda, ghoah gea jea eedukuteawa bakurajeega shiipka mida iheenga daranajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasin eara hoorgajeega, ak ghwayiin biriikajeega badahuuka hoorgajeega, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea basoanagi, ea heew damaniyeenya ghwayiin hing'eadayda nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak dahuundiga, ea mageemboojiga ea gijiikwajeega, ea dabita sean gwasin Huramabi aba gharinga sikula gidayda, aba gadiyeeda sugoocheanda was Sulemani bea gadiyeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba jeeda mooheeda Yordani gwasin sugoocheanda, aba sheang'weeda durumwana mida dageascheeda Sukoti ea ng'eanyiida Sareda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Sulemani gwasin ng'asheesu aba seang'ayda, nea durumanata gharinga ea mwoamu eeteen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin Sulemani haleanjeeda sean mida jeeda gheeda ASEETA, nea haleanjeeda sin suh gil: heeda wagiida sisna lagheanga siguura dahaabu, ea meesayda siyiina mukaateeyda giihiimnooda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea hoorgajeega ea gheaboong'nyeeka nyaawa sisna dahaabooda miyaas, inyeesa geaghwarda ak geanung' ghwayeat aba jeeda gheeda ghaydit, gawuurji gida ghayi sirukuteayda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea deakghweega, ea gheaboonyanga, ea beleeshajeega lagheanga miyaas; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea makaasajeega, ea bakurajeega, ea gweerajeega lukghumajeega, ea gharinyeanda sigwariideawa hideeda, lagheanga miyaasiin was dahaabu; ea gidaghuuta gheeda sibata ASEETA, ea gidaghuusiga heeda ghaydit muuchi, ea gidaghuusiga duukusa jarooda bea gheeda sibata ASEETA geesina lagheanga siguura dahaabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
